===Verb===
{{en-verb|circumscrib|ing}}

# To draw a line around; to [[encircle]].
# To limit narrowly; to [[restrict]].
# {{geometry}} To draw the [[small]]est [[circle]] or higher-dimensional [[sphere]] that has (a polyhedron, polygon, etc.) in its interior.

